{"parentUuid":"0ed1a72c-3820-4678-95bd-143db59abca4","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"ae0d80dfdeb39ff29","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016gsDFTL6WSGTFRX1xaqxfr","type":"tool_result","content":"docs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md:3:# 02 · Skill Dependency Graph\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md:7:## Domain-level dependencies (required edges)\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md:129:## Contracts\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md:198:## Critical contracts (top fan-in, excluding universals)\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md:213:## Runtime coupling cycles\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md:219:## Per-skill dependencies\ndocs/04-cross-cutting.md:3:# 04 · Cross-Cutting Skills\ndocs/04-cross-cutting.md:31:## Cross-cutting and orchestration skills\ndocs/04-cross-cutting.md:48:## Universal contracts\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:3:# 05 · Critic Framework\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:7:## Stages\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:16:## Critics\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:18:### K-ARCH · Engine Architecture Critic\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:26:### K-RENDER · Rendering Critic\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:34:### K-SYSTEMS · Systems Critic\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:42:### K-SIM · Physics & Simulation Critic\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:50:### K-NET · Networking Critic\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:58:### K-TOOLS · Tools & Editor Critic\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:66:### K-PLATFORM · Platform Critic\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:74:### K-PERF · Performance Critic\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:82:### K-PROD · Production Critic\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:90:### K-FUTURE · Future-Technology Critic\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:98:### K-COMPLETE · Completeness Critic\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:106:### K-LEGACY · Anti-Legacy Critic\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:114:### K-GAMEPLAY · Game Systems & Content Critic\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:122:### K-QUALITY · Quality & Security Critic\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:130:## Coverage matrix (stage G2 — which critics review which SKILL.md)\n24:  api_lifecycle_migration[\"API Lifecycle & Engine Migration\"]\n25-  developer_experience_docs[\"Developer Experience & Documentation\"]\n26-  ml_inference_runtime[\"ML Inference Runtime\"]\n27-  core_runtime_architect[\"Core Runtime Architect\"]\n28-  platform_architect[\"Platform Architect\"]\n29-  content_pipeline_architect[\"Content Pipeline Architect\"]\n30-  resource_streaming_architect[\"Resource & Streaming Architect\"]\n31-  world_architect[\"World Architect\"]\n32-  render_architect[\"Render Architect\"]\n--\n49:  api_lifecycle_migration --> core_runtime_architect\n50:  api_lifecycle_migration --> gameplay_architect\n51:  api_lifecycle_migration --> platform_architect\n52:  api_lifecycle_migration --> resource_streaming_architect\n53-  audio_architect --> content_pipeline_architect\n54-  audio_architect --> core_runtime_architect\n55-  audio_architect --> platform_architect\n56-  audio_architect --> resource_streaming_architect\n57-  audio_architect --> ui_architect\n58-  audio_architect --> world_architect\n59-  build_release_architect --> content_pipeline_architect\n60-  build_release_architect --> platform_architect\n--\n67:  editor_architect --> api_lifecycle_migration\n68-  editor_architect --> content_pipeline_architect\n69-  editor_architect --> core_runtime_architect\n70-  editor_architect --> observability_telemetry\n71-  editor_architect --> render_architect\n72-  editor_architect --> ui_architect\n73-  editor_architect --> world_architect\n74-  gameplay_architect --> animation_architect\n75-  gameplay_architect --> core_runtime_architect\n--\n137:| `C-PAL` Platform abstraction layer | 0 | platform-architect | — | 18 | OS services, CPU/GPU capability discovery, windowing, lifecycle events. No platform #ifdefs above this line. |\n138-| `C-PHYS` Physics world & scene queries | 3 | physics-architect | C-SPATIAL, C-ECS | 18 | Bodies, shapes, queries, contact events, stepping phases. |\n139-| `C-TASK` Task graph & job API | 1 | job-system-task-graph | C-SYNC, C-MEM | 17 | Task creation, dependencies, priorities, blocking rules, completion integration. |\n140-| `C-COOK` Cook-step processors | 5 | content-pipeline-architect | C-ASSET, C-SER, C-TASK | 15 | Processor inputs, cache keys, determinism, platform variants. |\n141-| `C-SER` Serialization & schema evolution | 2 | serialization-schema | C-REFL | 12 | Formats, versioning, upgraders, canonical form, untrusted-input rules. |\n142-| `C-ECS` ECS | 2 | ecs-runtime | C-ID, C-TASK, C-FRAME | 11 | Components, queries, systems, access declarations, command buffers. |\n143-| `C-ANIM` Animation pose output | 3 | animation-architect | C-ECS, C-SPATIAL | 10 | Pose buffers, root motion, animation events, physics/render hand-off. |","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"898e0360-e105-4a40-b971-5478e298866c","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:47:17.404Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0ed1a72c-3820-4678-95bd-143db59abca4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
